    "description": "Keep, level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. A grand stone keep after the approved sample: 15 x 15 on a cobblestone apron, four corner towers with corbelled tops, a gatehouse with an arched passage, battlements on corbels, a great hall with a throne, tables and a hearth, stairs (no ladders) to the king's rooms and the roof deck. 16 tall: needs scaffold in game. Not yet builder-tested: cracked_stone_bricks, mossy_stone_bricks, red_banner, red_wall_banner.",
    "changes": "New keep from the approved sample, bigger and grander: 15 x 15 with four corner towers, a gatehouse front, a great hall and stairs up to the roof; level 1 is the buildable shell, levels 2 and 3 add the battlements, banners, lanterns and details.",
